Some weights of the model checkpoint at TinyLlama/TinyLlama-1.1B-Chat-v1.0 were not used when initializing FlaxLlamaModel: {('lm_head', 'kernel')}
- This IS expected if you are initializing FlaxLlamaModel from the checkpoint of a model trained on another task or with another architecture (e.g. initializing a BertForSequenceClassification model from a BertForPreTraining model).
- This IS NOT expected if you are initializing FlaxLlamaModel from the checkpoint of a model that you expect to be exactly identical (initializing a BertForSequenceClassification model from a BertForSequenceClassification model).
